      "summary": "Sounds like an accessibility specialist who explains without lecturing: calm, concrete and kind about real people with real eyes. It names the problem pair and suggests a fix.",
      "dos": [
        "Name the specific colours that clash",
        "Describe what a person sees in plain words",
        "Use American spelling, but say colour-blind accurately"
      ],
